 development.LACTALIS:Lactalis is a global dairy products company that produces a variety of milk-based nutritional products, including those for infants and children.REAL DECRETO 165/2014:REAL DECRETO 165/2014 is a Spanish regulation that establishes additional standards for the nutritional labeling and composition of infant formulas. It specifically outlines the requirements for infant nutrition products in Spain, ensuring that these products meet certain safety and quality standards for the health and well-being of infants.NUTRINIMAX:Nutrinimax is a nutritional formula by Nutricia for children aged 7-12 years, aimed at providing essential nutrients for growth and development.NUTRINIMAX MF:Nutrinimax MF is a modified version of Nutrinimax, tailored for children aged 7-12 years with specific dietary requirements.NUTRINIMAX ENERGY:Nutrinimax Energy is a high-energy nutritional formula by Nutricia for children aged 7-12 years, focusing on energy needs.NUTRINIMAX ENERGY MF:Nutrinimax Energy MF is a modified high-energy formula for children aged 7-12 years, produced by Nutricia.RESOURCE IBD:Resource IBD is a nutritional product by Nestl√© designed for children over 5 years with Crohn's disease, providing specialized dietary support.RESOURCE CF:Resource CF is a nutritional formula by Nestl√© for children aged 1-10 years, formulated to meet the dietary needs of those with cystic fibrosis.RESOURCE JUNIOR:Resource Junior is a nutritional product by Nestl√© for children aged 1-10 years, providing essential nutrients for growth.RESOURCE JUNIOR FIBRE:Resource Junior Fibre is a fiber-enriched nutritional formula by Nestl√© for children aged 1-10 years, aimed at promoting digestive health.SANUTRI FQ:Sanutri FQ is a nutritional product by Lactalis for children over 2 years, designed to meet their dietary needs.FORMULAS PARA LACTANTES:Las f√≥rmulas para lactantes son sustitutos apropiados para la alimentaci√≥n de los lactantes nacidos a t√©rmino durante el primer a√±o de vida.LEGISLACION EUROPEA:La nueva legislaci√≥n europea, aplicable en 2020, establece que todas las f√≥rmulas para lactantes deben contener DHA en una cantidad espec√≠fica.F√ìRMULAS PARA LACTANTES:F√ìRMULAS DE SOJA:F√ìRMULAS DE SOJA are specialized nutritional preparations made from purified soy protein, designed for infants with specific dietary needs.ALERGIA A PROTE√çNAS DE LECHE DE VACA:ALERGIA A PROTE√çNAS DE LECHE DE VACA is an allergic reaction to proteins found in cow's milk, necessitating alternative formulas for affected infants.F√ìRMULAS ESPECIALES ALTERNATIVAS:F√ìRMULAS ESPECIALES ALTERNATIVAS are specialized formulas used when standard cow's milk-based formulas are not suitable for infants.L-METIONINA:L-METIONINA is an essential amino acid that plays a crucial role in protein synthesis and metabolism. It is commonly added to soy formulas to ensure adequate protein quality for infants, thereby supporting their growth and development. Additionally, L-METIONINA serves as a precursor for other amino acids, highlighting its importance in various metabolic processes.DIARREA PERSISTENTE:DIARREA PERSISTENTE refers to a condition that may affect infants, requiring special dietary considerations.ENTEROPAT√çA SENSIBLE A LECHE DE VACA:ENTEROPAT√çA SENSIBLE A LECHE DE VACA is a condition in which infants have adverse reactions to cow's milk proteins.S√çNDROME POSTENTERITIS:S√çNDROME POSTENTERITIS is a condition that can occur in infants after gastrointestinal infections, affecting their dietary needs.APLV:APLV refers to the allergy to cow's milk protein mediated by IgE, which is a condition affecting infants and children.SOY FORMULAS:Soy formulas are dietary products that are contraindicated for premature newborns due to health risks associated with their use.HYDROLYZED FORMULAS:Hydrolyzed formulas are developed for infants with severe allergies to cow's milk proteins and are recommended for children with such allergies or malabsorption issues.ELEMENTAL FORMULAS:Elemental formulas are specialized dietary products designed for children aged 1 to 10 years with specific nutritional needs.PROCTOCOLITIS:Proctocolitis is an inflammatory condition affecting the colon and rectum, which can be associated with allergies in infants.SUCRASE-ISOMALTASE DEFICIENCY:Sucrase-isomaltase deficiency is a condition that affects the digestion of certain sugars, relevant in the context of infant nutrition.COW'S MILK PROTEIN:ENTEROCOLITIS NECROSANTE:La enterocolitis necrosante es una complicaci√≥n grave que puede afectar a los reci√©n nacidos prematuros, caracterizada por la inflamaci√≥n y la muerte del tejido intestinal.CPAP:La CPAP (presi√≥n positiva continua de la v√≠a a√©rea) es un m√©todo de soporte respiratorio que se utiliza en reci√©n nacidos prematuros y puede influir en su alimentaci√≥n.(N␀␀␀␀␀␀±N␀␀␀␀␀␀MO␀␀␀␀␀␀•O␀␀␀␀␀␀P␀␀␀␀␀␀_P␀␀␀␀␀␀’P␀␀␀␀␀␀+Q␀␀␀␀␀␀oQ␀␀␀␀␀␀«Q␀␀␀␀␀␀AR␀␀␀␀␀␀üR␀␀␀␀␀␀·R␀␀␀␀␀␀9S␀␀␀␀␀␀±S␀␀␀␀␀␀T␀␀␀␀␀␀KT␀␀␀␀␀␀ßT␀␀␀␀␀␀U␀␀␀␀␀␀ÉU␀␀␀␀␀␀«U␀␀␀␀␀␀V␀␀␀␀␀␀óV␀␀␀␀␀␀†V␀␀␀␀␀␀+W␀␀␀␀␀␀»W␀␀␀␀␀␀FX␀␀␀␀␀␀•X␀␀␀␀␀␀5[␀␀␀␀␀␀ø[␀␀␀␀␀␀,\␀␀␀␀␀␀r\␀␀␀␀␀␀Û\␀␀␀␀␀␀]␀␀␀␀␀␀ª]␀␀␀␀␀␀x^␀␀␀␀␀␀_␀␀␀␀␀␀ô_␀␀␀␀␀␀@`␀␀␀␀␀␀–`␀␀␀␀␀␀ta␀␀␀␀␀␀˜a␀␀␀␀␀␀ëb␀␀␀␀␀␀Cc␀␀␀␀␀␀Ùc␀␀␀␀␀␀Æd␀␀␀␀␀␀Oe␀␀␀␀␀␀&f␀␀␀␀␀␀g␀␀␀␀␀␀∆g␀␀␀␀␀␀lh␀␀␀␀␀␀i␀␀␀␀␀␀k␀␀␀␀␀␀ák␀␀␀␀␀␀Zl␀␀␀␀␀␀m␀␀␀␀␀␀ﬁm␀␀␀␀␀␀sn␀␀␀␀␀␀*o␀␀␀␀␀␀Øp␀␀␀␀␀␀Zq␀␀␀␀␀␀˘q␀␀␀␀␀␀èr␀␀␀␀␀␀:s␀␀␀␀␀␀”s␀␀␀␀␀␀`t␀␀␀␀␀␀Ít␀␀␀␀␀␀:u␀␀␀␀␀␀≥u␀␀␀␀␀␀%v␀␀␀␀␀␀ˆw␀␀␀␀␀␀kx␀␀␀␀␀␀‰x␀␀␀␀␀␀Mz␀␀␀␀␀␀„z␀␀␀␀␀␀ö{␀␀␀␀␀␀1|␀␀␀␀␀␀¡|␀␀␀␀␀␀¡~␀␀␀␀␀␀NÅ␀␀␀␀␀␀ÊÅ␀␀␀␀␀␀oÇ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀É␀␀␀␀␀␀pÉ␀␀␀␀␀␀˝É␀␀␀␀␀␀Ñ␀␀␀␀␀␀ÓÖ␀␀␀␀␀␀}Ü␀␀␀␀␀␀5á␀␀␀␀␀␀Ãá␀␀␀␀␀␀nà␀␀␀␀␀␀¬à␀␀␀␀␀␀@â␀␀␀␀␀␀⁄â␀␀␀␀␀␀kä␀␀␀␀␀␀ã␀␀␀␀␀␀äã␀␀␀␀␀␀~ç␀␀␀␀␀␀é␀␀␀␀␀␀¿é␀␀␀␀␀␀è␀␀␀␀␀␀Äè␀␀␀␀␀␀¨ê␀␀␀␀␀␀ë␀␀␀␀␀␀Öë␀␀␀␀␀␀„ë␀␀␀␀␀␀1í␀␀␀␀␀␀9î␀␀␀␀␀␀ûî␀␀␀␀␀␀Ùî␀␀␀␀␀␀<ï␀␀␀␀␀␀éï␀␀␀␀␀␀Ëï␀␀␀␀␀␀@ñ␀␀␀␀␀␀öñ␀␀␀␀␀␀ó␀␀␀␀␀␀Wò␀␀␀␀␀␀Ãò␀␀␀␀␀␀:ô␀␀␀␀␀␀ùô␀␀␀␀␀␀˚ô␀␀␀␀␀␀hö␀␀␀␀␀␀…ö␀␀␀␀␀␀ õ␀␀␀␀␀␀àõ␀␀␀␀␀␀Ûõ␀␀␀␀␀␀Qú␀␀␀␀␀␀≤ú␀␀␀␀␀␀ù␀␀␀␀␀␀Ïû␀␀␀␀␀␀^ü␀␀␀␀␀␀”ü␀␀␀␀␀␀M†␀␀␀␀␀␀ƒ†␀␀␀␀␀␀E°␀␀␀␀␀␀™°␀␀␀␀␀␀¢␀␀␀␀␀␀Ü¢␀␀␀␀␀␀Ì¢␀␀␀␀␀␀i£␀␀␀␀␀␀“£␀␀␀␀␀␀9§␀␀␀␀␀␀†§␀␀␀␀␀␀•␀␀␀␀␀␀x•␀␀␀␀␀␀‡•␀␀␀␀␀␀M¶␀␀␀␀␀␀∏¶␀␀␀␀␀␀Aß